"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4657760","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1847286114030634","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 River Drift Has Reached 11,000 Wishlists!","summary":"I can't thank you all enough for the incredible support you've shown River Drift so far. As a solo indie developer, seeing so many people interested in my game means the world to me!With the Steam Next Fest underway, this is the perfect time to jump into the river, grab a friend, and see if you can survive the chaos! 🛶🐊If you haven't tried the demo yet, give it a shot and let me know what you think. Your feedback helps me make River Drift even better before launch!Thank you for being part of thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:48:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030634","verified_at":"2026-10-22T04:32:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1846651706694482","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"🌊 River Drift Is Part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"🌊 River Drift Is Part of Steam Next Fest!Hello, Drifters! 🛶I'm excited to announce that River Drift is participating in Steam Next Fest, and the demo is available to play right now!Grab a friend, hop on a raft, and get ready for a chaotic co-op adventure through dangerous rivers, mysterious forests, and deadly swamps!🐊 Survive dangerous wildlife and unpredictable obstacles.🛶 Paddle together to navigate the river and keep your raft under control.🔥 Repair your raft and survive unexpected disasters","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:41:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1845383656395056","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"Paddle Controls Improved + Steam Join Game 🛶","summary":"You can now hold the paddle key to keep paddling without having to repeatedly press the button, making longer runs more comfortable and reducing fatigue.If you prefer the original playstyle, you can still spam the paddle key to paddle faster and maintain the same fast-paced gameplay as before!You can now join your friends directly from your Steam Friends List!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T01:51:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1845383656392919","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"update","title":"🌊 NEW RIVER DRIFT UPDATE! 🐊","summary":"🌊 NEW RIVER DRIFT UPDATE! 🐊Hey River Drifters!A new update is here, bringing some highly requested features and a bigger way to play together!👥 4-PLAYER CO-OP IS HERE! The Swamp Map now supports up to 4 players! Grab your friends, jump on the raft, and try to survive the river together! 🗺️ NEW MINI MAP It's now easier to see where you are and keep track of the river ahead! Use the new mini map to help navigate the different routes and forks in the river.⌨️ KEY REBINDING You can now rebind your k","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:04:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1844751498235469","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out now!","summary":"🌊 Hello, River Drifters! The River Drift demo is officially LIVE! 🎉Grab your friends, hop on the raft, and see if you can survive the river! 🐊🌿I’ve been working hard to get this demo ready, and I can’t wait to hear what you think!👉 Try the demo on Steam:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T21:06:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1844751498228204","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"River Drift fake website!!!","summary":"Hello everyone! Someone has created a fake website for my game and unfortunately, it looks pretty convincing. The problem is that the download button links to a virus. This website is not affiliated with me, and you should NOT download River Drift from it. Please only play River Drift through Steam and use the official Steam page to download the game. Stay safe!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T23:02:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1840310314340470","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"update","title":"River Drift Launch Update","summary":"I'm moving River Drift's launch to January 2027.The game will be part of Steam Next Fest this October, where I'll be releasing a demo. I want to take the time to listen to player feedback, polish the experience, and make meaningful improvements before launch.Thank you all for your continued support and feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T00:14:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4382680-1836506165561881","game_id":"steam-4382680","kind":"announcement","title":"River Drift Playtest is now LIVE! 🚣","summary":"Grab a friend and jump back into the river to experience the biggest update yet!What's New🌲 Explore a brand-new biome with fresh scenery and new challenges.⚠️ Face new obstacles that will test your teamwork and paddling skills.🎮 Improved UI and menus for a smoother experience.🚀 Major performance optimizations for more stable gameplay.🛶 Better multiplayer stability and session handling.✨ Numerous gameplay improvements, bug fixes, and quality-of-life updates based on community feedback.Whether you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T08:43:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165561881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4382680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4382680":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4382680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z"},"4657760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:44Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4382680","app_id":4382680,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","e